# Queued Next Task (Offline Runner Staging)

> Why `.ai/next_task.md`?
> GitHub Actions automatically cancels queued workflow runs if a self-hosted runner stays offline for > 24 hours.
> When the local workstation is asleep or offline, Claude on the Web writes the next experiment specification to `.ai/next_task.md` (which does NOT trigger `ai-loop.yml`).
> Once the workstation is online, rename or copy `.ai/next_task.md` -> `.ai/task.md` and push to trigger immediate execution.
